",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source B states this in equivalent words, using 'next' instead of 'another'.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-003\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"The stream name cant contain arbitrary symbols\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated in source A.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-004\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Stream names are validated against ^[A-Za-z0-9 -]+$ before the agent registers.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Verbatim match in source A's code block.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-005\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Only letters, digits, spaces and hyphens are accepted\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated in source B.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-006\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"letters, digits, spaces and hyphens only, and nothing else, or the agent refuses to start.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated in source A.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-007\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Stream name containing a . (dot) for exampe` checkout.web`\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source B gives checkout.web as an example containing a dot.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-008\",\"verdict\":\"MISSING\",\"evidence\":\"\",\"evidence_source\":\"\",\"rationale\":\"The source lists checkout.web as an example of a dot-containing name and separately mentions other symbols being refused generally, but does not state checkout.web itself contains other symbols besides the dot.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-009\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"are refused by Nimbrel Probe\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source B states such names are refused.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-010\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"one customer wanted the stream name left exactly as it stood\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated in source A.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-011\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"that string was the product name in use everywhere in the org\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated in source A.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-012\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"their reporting keyed of it\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated in source A, with original typo preserved.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-013\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Working as intended for now\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated under Cause in source B.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-014\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"All Nimbrel Probe agents\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated under Environment in source A.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-015\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"No fix at present , rename the stream without the refused symbol\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated under Resolution in source B.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-016\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Rename the stream to drop the unsupported symbols so the Nimbrel Probe agent will register\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated in source A's Instructions/Answer.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-017\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Then carry the orignal name along as a global tag, so at least each trace keeps a link between the real name and the renamed one\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated in source A's Instructions/Answer.\"}\n]}","ttft_ms":9667,"type":"result","duration_ms":19053,"uuid":"09221c28-4343-4bf0-936a-a306ae61817f","ttft_stream_ms":1153,"time_to_request_ms":92,"first_content_frame_ms":1153,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
